/-
# Tests.AnchorsBmi — D334 (W1c): the BMI1/BMI2 and MOVNTI pins, in a module of their own

Arm (A) of the 2026-10-10 kernel-cost fork, applied at landing.  Inside `Tests.Anchors` these 888 `decide` pins moved
that module's kernel time on the ledger machine from 2240 to 6240 ms against a budget of 521.9 (the ms delta gate,
base 24d3644).  In a module of their own they are a NEW unit, judged once against an absolute registration measured
on its own machine (`scripts/kernel_ceilings.txt`, `scripts/ku_delta_budget.txt`), and `Tests.Anchors` keeps its
budget — D311's rule (one test module per witness family), as the V1a branch applied it to its own pins.

The block between the markers is GENERATED by `hwprobe/mk_int_anchors.py` (`--check` gates it byte for byte).

LANE. Personal lane, public sources only.
-/
